  - `pointsJson` (stroke geometry) is FIELD-ENCRYPTED at rest now — title/extractedText/textContent/pointsJson are all encrypted fields (`saveStrokesForPage`, NoteRepository.kt); the Phase 02 restore re-key gap is closed.
  - "Sync" = WebDAV upload/download of ENCRYPTED backup archives to/from the user's own server (`WebDavSyncService.kt`, HTTPS enforced, HTTP only with explicit opt-in for local-network hosts), reachable from HomeScreen's ⋮ menu via `WebDavSyncDialog` — Phase 14 FIXED the previously-dead menu trigger; AGSL wet-mixing is WIRED through `WetBrushEngine` in `AnnotationCanvas` (gated by `ShaderCapabilityHelper.isAgslSupported` + the `gpuWetBrushesEnabled` setting, verified in the Phase 14 audit); pressure/tilt/timestamp are captured via the official raw-MotionEvent bridge (`pointerInteropFilter`, no reflection); FLAG_SECURE is applied in non-debug builds; R8 minify is ON in release; baseline profiles are NOT wired (deferred — the dead `baseline-prof.txt` was deleted in the Phase 03 honesty audit).
